WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

These books compile, grade and cite other people's research. The findings,
figures and datasets they describe remain the work of the investigators named
in each bibliography, under whatever terms those works carry. This licence
covers the compilation, the writing, the grading and the original diagrams —
not the underlying studies.

Where an image, a figure or a font carries a licence of its own, that licence
governs it. Each book lists them:
  nature-and-architecture/images/CREDITS.md
  nature-and-architecture-chatgpt/downloads/image-credits.html
The small copies of the ChatGPT book's photographs on its card on the front
page keep their licences too, and are credited in
  library/chatgpt-card/CREDITS.md
Fonts bundled with a book keep the licence file included beside them.

The cover mosaics in nature-and-architecture/images/ tile that book's
reproduced images, several of which are shared under CC BY-SA; the mosaics
are therefore shared under CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), and each tile keeps the
licence and credit given for it in CREDITS.md.
